<title>MALAYSIA: Malayawata plans 1-for-2 bonus issue.</title>
<headline>Malayawata plans 1-for-2 bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's Malayawata Steel Bhd has proposed a one-for-two bonus issue of 70.36 million new shares.</p>
<p>It said in a statement late on Monday that the bonus issue is to increase the company's paid-up capital to a level which would better reflect its current scale of operations.</p>
<p>Malayawata's net tangible assets per share would reduce to 1.86 ringgit from 2.92 ringgit after the bonus issue, it said.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
